<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78409" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμήκ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>oblong</i> or
			<i>oval</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχονδρίου σύντασις π. πρὸς ὀμφαλόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β᾽ ; τρῆμα, αὐλῶνες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.22.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				44
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					15.32
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίς, πίνακες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				16.4
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σφαιροειδές</span>
			<i>prolate</i> spheroid, <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Con.Sph.Praef.</u>
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					17.3.23
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. ἔντερον</span> the
				<i>rectum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SD</u>
				1.7
			</span></i> ; of military formations, opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάγιος, φάλαγξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ascl.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					10.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				26.2
			</span></i> : 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κέστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					19.6.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλου παραμηκεστέρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					5.26.3
				</span></i>
			. Adv., 
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμηκέως, κληΐς π. καταγεῖσα</span>,
			of a bone fractured <i>obliquely</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρεκέως</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>long</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὅσον ἑξήκοντα σταδίων τὸ μῆκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					9.1.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>lengthened</i>, of strokes in a letter, Aen. Tact. <i><span class="en">
				31.3
			</span></i>.</div>
